              "value": "Search Memory"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divination, mental, occult)\n\nWhen the loreavor damages a creature with its touch Strike, the creature must succeed at a 28 Will save or become stupefied 1, or stupefied 2 on a critical failure."
            },
            "id": "c70e8be4-892a-4b57-9b1d-f7f407a49cd7",
