        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Reconstruct Spell"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divination, mental, occult)\n\nTrigger: A creature within 30 feet attempts and fails to Cast a Spell while stupefied\n\nThe loreavor gains use of the failed spell as an occult innate spell. It can cast that spell once; if the spell is of a higher level than half the loreavor's level (5th level or higher for most loreavors), the loreavor must succeed at a flat check with a DC equal to 5 + the level of the spell it is attempting to cast; on a failure, the spell fails, and the loreavor becomes stupefied 1 for 1 minute. If the spell isn't cast within 24 hours, or if the loreavor uses Reconstruct Spell again before casting the spell, the spell is lost. No more than one loreavor can reconstruct a given spell this way."
            },
